---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import enTranslations from '../../locales/en/translation.json'

const pageTitle = enTranslations.page_title || ''
const pageDescription = enTranslations.page_description || ''
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" pageTitle={pageTitle} pageDescription={pageDescription}>
  <section class="w-full">
    <h1
      class="title bg-gradient-to-r from-accent-two/85 via-accent-one/85 to-accent-two/85 bg-clip-text text-center text-transparent dark:from-accent-two dark:via-accent-one dark:to-accent-two"
    >
      Voting from Abroad – Simple, Digital, Secure
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
      This tool is designed for Serbian citizens living abroad who wish to
      register to vote. We assist You in filling out the form, attaching Your
      passport, and submitting the application to the embassy – without hassle.
      <br /><br />
      A process that once required printing, scanning, and hours of searching for
      information now takes only a few minutes. All data is processed locally on
      Your device, with no storage or transmission to servers – fully secure and
      transparent.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-6 w-full">
    <h2 class="title mb-4 text-center text-xl text-accent-two">
      Important Notice
    </h2>

    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
      This website is <strong
        >not an official platform of any government institution</strong
      >, but an independent initiative aimed at helping Serbian citizens abroad
      register for voting more easily.
      <br /><br />
      <strong>We do not collect or store any personal data.</strong> All information
      is processed <strong>locally</strong> on Your device – nothing is sent to servers
      or saved online.
      <br /><br />
      Use of this website is <strong>not mandatory</strong>. You may also fill
      out the registration form manually. Detailed instructions can be found on
      the <a
        href="https://www.mfa.gov.rs"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="text-accent-two underline-offset-2 hover:underline"
        >official website of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs</a
      > or obtained from Your nearest embassy or consulate.
      <br /><br />
      Our mission is to provide You with a simpler and more secure way to exercise
      Your voting rights – with full control and transparency. Your vote can be crucial
      – make it count.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12 w-full">
    <div class="mt-10 flex items-center justify-center gap-6">
      <a
        href={enTranslations.header_nav.handbook_path}
        class="rounded-lg bg-accent-two px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-md transition duration-200 hover:bg-accent-two/90"
      >
        Learn More
      </a>
      <a
        href={enTranslations.header_nav.form_path}
        class="rounded-lg border border-accent-two px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-accent-two transition duration-200 hover:bg-accent-two hover:text-white"
      >
        Submit Request
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
